Subject: [PATCH 10/14] Update connection logic to ensure users connect to the
 correct WebSocket domain

Modify storage logic to validate the WebSocket URL host against the current location.host, resetting to defaults if mismatched or if the protocol is not ws/wss. Also ensures the pathname always ends with /ws.

